Something useful about box breathing: one round of 4-4-4-4 takes 16 seconds, so four rounds is about a minute. That's a decent reset when a feed has wound you up.

You can also stop once your breath slows on its own and your shoulders drop. More minutes aren't automatically better. If the holds feel like a lot, 3-3-3-3 works too.
